---
name: fmt-non-ascii
description: Café, naïve, résumé — “quoted” ✓ 日本語.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [lead, worker]
---

      %% Ünïcödé comment: «ça va» — ✓.
contract @1h => expired   
role lead
role worker
   %% Second comment, naïve: 日本語.
type offer
      """
      Docs with naïve accents shift as a whole — ✓ 日本語.
      """
    task:text(1..200)
type memo
"""
  →	No-break spaces lead this line; the tab after the arrow is not leading whitespace.
"""
  text: text(1..200)
state new
  lead -> worker: offer()=>done
     "L’offre est arrivée."   
end done
